          "name": "Blog split layout34",
          "settings": {
            "image_max_width": 450,
            "image_border_color": "#224b38",
            "heading": "<p>1. You’re bloated by afternoon no matter<br/>what you eat</p>",
            "paragraph_1": "<p>Most people assume it’s food sensitivity. It’s usually not.</p>",
            "paragraph_2": "<p>When parasites and old waste build up along the colon wall, they create a biofilm layer that traps gas and slows digestion to a crawl. Your gut physically can’t move things through the way it’s supposed to  so it sits there. <strong>And ferments.</strong></p>",
            "paragraph_3": "<p><strong>Rootvana’s Soursop and Oregano at full extract strength </strong>break down that biofilm layer. Burdock Root gets bile moving again so food doesn’t sit and ferment in the first place.</p>",
            "background_color": "#224b38",
            "text_color": "#ffffff",
            "vertical_padding": 30,
            "heading_size": 24,
            "text_size": 16,
            "paragraph_spacing": 20
          },
