            "padding_vertical": 5,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "heading": "<p>2. You’re itchy at night for no clear<br/>reason</p>",
            "heading_size": 28,
            "paragraph_1": "<p>When parasites are active, they often move and lay eggs overnight which is why the itching tends to show up specifically after dark.</p>",
            "paragraph_2": "<p>Most people chalk it up to dry skin or allergies. <strong>It’s rarely either one.</strong></p>",
            "paragraph_3": "<p><strong>Black Seed Oil</strong> at 200mg extract has been used for over 2,000 years specifically for this. It targets what’s active at the source, not just the surface symptom.</p>",
            "paragraph_size": 16,
            "text_gap": 0,
            "paragraph_gap": 0,
            "text_color": "#000000",
            "image_width": 70
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
