          "name": "Blog split layout34",
          "settings": {
            "image_max_width": 450,
            "image_border_color": "#224b38",
            "heading": "<p>5. You just don’t feel sharp… there’s a fog you can’t explain</p>",
            "paragraph_1": "<p>Parasites release waste byproducts directly into your bloodstream. Your liver and gut are supposed to filter this  but when they’re overloaded, that toxic load reaches your brain.</p>",
            "paragraph_2": "<p>Most people try nootropics or more caffeine. <strong>They never look at the gut.</strong></p>",
            "paragraph_3": "<p><strong>20 botanicals working together</strong> clearing the source, not masking the symptom. When the gut isn’t carrying that load anymore, the fog lifts. Not from a stimulant. From your gut finally doing its job.</p>",
