            "vertical_padding": 20,
            "image_max_width": 300,
            "image_border_color": "#ffffff",
            "heading": "<p>3. It Actually Protects Against Clots. Aspirin Doesn't</p>",
            "heading_size": 32,
            "paragraph_1": "<p>Aspirin blocks platelet clumping. One mechanism. Hemo Flow breaks down the protein that forms clots through four pathways. That's the difference between covering one risk and actually addressing it.</p>",
            "paragraph_2": "",
            "paragraph_3": "",
